14
00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:36,540
(Raj:)I'm kidding, Hawaii.

15
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:38,460
(Raj:)Mahalo.

16
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:40,510
(Raj:)Whoo!

17
00:00:41,530 --> 00:00:42,930
